        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At such time as we market, sell and distribute any products for which we obtain marketing approval, it is possible that our business activities could be subject to scrutiny and enforcement under one or more federal or state health care fraud and abuse laws and regulations.",
        "start_character": 114222,
        "end_character": 114495
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Government authorities in the United States, at the federal, state and local level, and in other countries extensively regulate, among other things, the research, development, testing, manufacture, quality control, approval, labeling, packaging, storage, record-keeping, promotion, advertising, distribution, post-approval monitoring and reporting, marketing and export and import of products such as those we develop.",
        "start_character": 86260,
        "end_character": 86678
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, to obtain payments under this program, we would be required to sell products to Medicare recipients through private prescription drug plans that contract with the federal government and adhere to certain minimum requirements.",
        "start_character": 126604,
        "end_character": 126838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are not able to develop new products that can compete effectively against our current and future competitors, our business will not grow and our financial condition, operations and stock price will suffer.",
        "start_character": 81082,
        "end_character": 81293
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we are unable to raise capital or enter into such agreements as, and when, needed, we may have to significantly delay, scale back or discontinue the further development and commercialization efforts of one or more of our products, or may be forced to reduce or terminate our operations.",
        "start_character": 5504,
        "end_character": 5793
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we do infringe such patents or other proprietary rights, we could be prevented from developing or selling products or from using the processes covered by those patents, could be required to pay substantial damages, or could be required to obtain a license from the third party to allow us to use their technology, which may not be available on commercially reasonable terms or at all.",
        "start_character": 84125,
        "end_character": 84512
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we were not able to obtain a required license or develop alternative technologies, we may be unable to develop or commercialize some or all of our products, and our business could be adversely affected.",
        "start_character": 84513,
        "end_character": 84718
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to distribute products commercially, we must comply with state laws that require the registration of manufacturers and wholesale distributors of pharmaceutical products in a state, including, in certain states, manufacturers and distributors who ship products into the state even if such manufacturers or distributors have no place of business within the state.",
        "start_character": 119839,
        "end_character": 120209
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To date, we have relied on third-party manufacturers, including manufacturers in China, for supply of active pharmaceutical ingredients and ingredients for use in clinical trials of our product candidates.",
        "start_character": 135784,
        "end_character": 135989
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also expect that in the future we will rely on such manufacturers to produce commercial quantities of any product candidates that we commercialize ourselves.",
        "start_character": 135990,
        "end_character": 136150
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-288121",
        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also receive annually tiered, double-digit royalties per protease inhibitor product developed under the agreement, which range from ten percent up to twenty percent, or on a blended basis from the low double digits up to the high teens.",
        "start_character": 57853,
        "end_character": 58092
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-288121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-288121-a43b637b7347ce52",
